Package: uzunyx-genie
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: kwin-wayland (>= @KWIN@), kwin-wayland (<< @KWIN@.~)
Conflicts: kwin-effect-genieanywhere
Replaces: kwin-effect-genieanywhere
Description: macOS-like genie minimize animation for Uzunyx
 Genie Anywhere, a KWin effect based on KWin's Magic Lamp: minimized
 windows pour into their task manager button like macOS's genie (the
 window first narrows into a funnel towards the button, then slides down
 into it), drawn above the other windows while animating. The target can be
 any spot of a panel, per app or for every window (Super+Ctrl+L to pick).
 It also animates Tsunyx Launcher's opening and closing in its "magic lamp"
 mode.
 .
 While loaded it replaces KWin's Magic Lamp, which stays enabled as a
 fallback. Built against one exact KWin version: KWin refuses to load it in
 any other, so it must be rebuilt after every KWin update.
